  "interpretation": [
    "Doubling configured sources from four to eight was associated with about 1.86× the median commit call and about 2.05× the median initial ACK-processing call in this local implementation and workload.",
    "Strict authority required every configured source to be present, so quorum variation changed the threshold, not the number of sources collected or consumed. These quorum contrasts do not measure partial-quorum early-stop behavior.",
    "Data-loss and ACK-loss recovery costs are separately phase-profiled. The ACK-loss path includes duplicate cleanup after the receiver has already applied and consumed the original event.",
    "Checkpoint save spans are nested inside commit_event spans; checkpoint totals must not be added to commit_event duration."
  ],
